Comment: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.31,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Corra, corra
Comment: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.40,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,segurando nossa bandeira bem alto no céu
Comment: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:17.99,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Vamos atravessar esse mar sem fim em busca de
Comment: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:21.75,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,um milagre global que ninguém
Comment: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.83,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,ainda foi capaz de encontrar
Comment: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:27.92,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Com nossos corações\Nbatendo forte, vamos
Comment: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.71,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,seguir em frente como\Nquisermos, seguindo
Comment: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,as pegadas daqueles que perseguem seus sonhos
Comment: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:39.39,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Não importa quão\Ntempestuosa seja a noite,
Comment: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.35,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,se unirmos nossos\Ncorações como um só
Comment: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:46.52,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,seremos capazes
Comment: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:47.77,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,de superar sempre
Comment: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:51.57,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Corra, corra segurando
Comment: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:54.53,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,nossa bandeira bem alto no céu
Comment: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:57.07,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mesmo que haja lágrimas
Comment: 0,0:00:57.16,0:01:00.49,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,não queremos que ninguém veja
Comment: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.45,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Persiga, persiga,
Comment: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:06.46,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,se você quiser\Nrealizar o nosso sonho
Comment: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.13,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,devemos sempre olhar\Npara frente sem medo
Comment: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:11.38,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Não podemos parar aqui
Comment: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.43,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Corra, corra,
Comment: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:24.48,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,passe por todos os outros
Comment: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.06,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Enquanto não fugirmos disso,
Comment: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:30.48,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,30)}podemos agarrar o amanhã em nossas mãos
Comment: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:33.57,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Persiga, persiga, tudo o
Comment: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:36.49,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,que vemos diante de nós,
Comment: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:38.86,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,vamos esculpi-lo no
Comment: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.37,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,páginas em branco dos nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}Corra, corra!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Translation,,0,0,0,,Erguendo bem alto sua bandeira aos céus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Translation,,0,0,0,,Vamos cruzar este mar sem fim 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Translation,,0,0,0,,em busca do milagre que 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Translation,,0,0,0,,ninguém ainda encontrou!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,Avançaremos seguindo os desejos de nossos corações pulsantes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Translation,,0,0,0,,seguindo as pegadas daqueles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Translation,,0,0,0,,que perseguem seus sonhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Translation,,0,0,0,,Por mais tormentuosa que seja a noite,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Translation,,0,0,0,,se unirmos nossos corações,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}nós vamos superá-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Translation,,0,0,0,,Sempre!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Translation,,0,0,0,,Corra, corra!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}Erguendo bem alto sua bandeira aos céus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Translation,,0,0,0,,Mesmo se rolarem lágrimas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}que ninguém mais verá
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,Persiga, persiga...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,o sonho indicado pela bússola,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Translation,,0,0,0,,olhando sempre em frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:14.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}Não podemos parar a volta ao mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:16.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}Me incendeie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Translation,,0,0,0,,Corra, corra!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Translation,,0,0,0,,Chegue mais longe que todo mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,Se não desviarmos de nossa rota,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)}o amanhã estará em nossas mãos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Translation,,0,0,0,,Persiga, persiga...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Translation,,0,0,0,,que tudo que vemos diante de nós.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Translation,,0,0,0,,Vamos escrever nas páginas em branco...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Translation,,0,0,0,,em nossos corações!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:46.43,Translation,,0,0,0,,Admirável Mundo Novo, me incendeie!
